    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  Phew...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "Phew..."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  Guys, it looks like we'll be stationed here for a while.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "Guys, it looks like we'll be stationed here for a while."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ines\"]  What happened?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ines",
        "content": "What happened?"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  The scouts spotted a Catastrophe brewing, with no Catastrophe Messengers nearby. We should stay as far away as possible, just in case.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "The scouts spotted a Catastrophe brewing, with no Catastrophe Messengers nearby. We should stay as far away as possible, just in case."
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  We can't risk it, no matter what.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "We can't risk it, no matter what."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ines\"]  ...A Catastrophe, huh?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ines",
        "content": "...A Catastrophe, huh?"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  It's rare to see one raging in the wilderness.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "It's rare to see one raging in the wilderness."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  But we have plenty of experience dealing with Originium in Kazdel, so no need to panic.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "But we have plenty of experience dealing with Originium in Kazdel, so no need to panic."
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  ...Where's W?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "...Where's W?"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ines\"]  She's with her team.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ines",
        "content": "She's with her team."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ines\"]  ...Need her for something?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ines",
        "content": "...Need her for something?"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  I'm... not sure. She's changed a lot.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "I'm... not sure. She's changed a lot."
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ines\"]  Do you think her personality would change that much just because Theresa is gone?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ines",
        "content": "Do you think her personality would change that much just because Theresa is gone?"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  She's too calm. It's unlike her.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "She's too calm. It's unlike her."
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  But when we found her on the battlefield earlier, she still had that cynical, sarcastic expression.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "But when we found her on the battlefield earlier, she still had that cynical, sarcastic expression."
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ines\"]  If anything, she's only gotten worse.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ines",
        "content": "If anything, she's only gotten worse."
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ines\"]  That's odd. I never thought you'd be perceptive enough to pick up on these subtle warning signs.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ines",
        "content": "That's odd. I never thought you'd be perceptive enough to pick up on these subtle warning signs."
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoederer\"]  ...Save the jabs. If W's being quiet, that warning sign's far from 'subtle.'",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoederer",
        "content": "...Save the jabs. If W's being quiet, that warning sign's far from 'subtle.'"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_052\",name2=\"avg_npc_047\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ines\"]  W, she... Oh—",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ines",
        "content": "W, she... Oh—"
    },
