        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 157,
        "raw": "[name=\"Sarkaz Warrior\"]  That can't be why you set our rendezvous point right under a Catastrophe, right...? Are you trying to get me killed?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Sarkaz Warrior",
        "content": "That can't be why you set our rendezvous point right under a Catastrophe, right...? Are you trying to get me killed?"
    },
    {
        "id": 158,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_046#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 159,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  Hey, don't put it that way.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Hey, don't put it that way."
    },
    {
        "id": 160,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  Do you know what the biggest perk of being a lunatic is?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "Do you know what the biggest perk of being a lunatic is?"
    },
    {
        "id": 161,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 162,
        "raw": "[name=\"Sarkaz Warrior\"]  I'm not sure I want to know. But, I already have a pretty good idea just from following you, boss.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Sarkaz Warrior",
        "content": "I'm not sure I want to know. But, I already have a pretty good idea just from following you, boss."
    },
    {
        "id": 163,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_046#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 164,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  That's right.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "That's right."
    },
    {
        "id": 165,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  It's this. The crazier shit you do, the less others question you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "It's this. The crazier shit you do, the less others question you."
    },
